                                "example_id": "b22e0946-4662-45da-bb41-d2f6025164dc",
                                "sense_id": "cce8076f-9d5a-3dcf-85c6-9361a8794a2b",
                                "text": "‘Re-privatisation,’ as it is called, has, however, been under way in the cases of all three banks. Some 40 per cent of the G.D. Bank’s holding of Deutsche-Disconto shares had passed back into private hands by the end of 1935. The new advance of bank shares to above par ought to smooth the way for complete ‘re-privatisation.’"
                            },
                            {
