                                "sense_id": "cce8076f-9d5a-3dcf-85c6-9361a8794a2b",
                                "text": "POLITICAL OBSTACLES The process of nationalization and reprivatization went amazingly well in Sweden partly because it was remarkably free of political interference."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
